        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 25 at 3:33AM CDT until September 25 at 8:00AM CDT by NWS Duluth MN</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility one quarter to one half mile in dense fog.

* WHERE...In Minnesota, Carlton and South St. Louis County. In
Wisconsin, Douglas County.

* WHEN...Until 8 AM CDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The lowest visibilities will be found in the
St. Louis River Valley between the Twin Ports and Cloquet.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your low-beam headlights and fog lights,
and leave plenty of distance ahead of you.</instruction>
